        "title": "",
        "liquid": "<div class=\"three-column-grid fw-white-bg\">\n<div class=\"grid-column\" style=\"max-width: 120px !important; padding: 0px; \">\n<img src=\"//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/5752/1780/files/brisa-packs.png?v=1775142199\" style=\"position: relative; top: -50px; transform: rotate(180deg);\">\n    \n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid-column\" style=\"padding-left: var(--container-gutter);\">\n<a class=\"home_button\" style=\"background: #ff0000\" >ALREADY HAVE A BRISA?</a>\n    <h3 class=\"heading h2\">GRAB YOUR CORE REFILLS HERE.</h3>\n    <p>Kits are sold out, we have enough cores to supply our already brisa customers, refill here:.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid-column\" style=\"max-width: 120px !important; text-align: right; padding: 0px; \">\n<img src=\"//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0939/5752/1780/files/brisa-packs.png?v=1775142199\" style=\"position: relative; top: -50px\">\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0;\">\n\n<div class=\"option\">\n<div class=\"title\">\nOption 1\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\nDM us @Brisabetter.au to create a custom pack, and we will send you details there. to get it shipped out that day\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"option\">\n<div class=\"title\">\nOption 2 - Direct Transfer\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\nDM us @Brisabetter.au to create a custom pack, and we will send you details there. to get it shipped out that day\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>",
